</div><p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">3.C. Reasons for the Offer and Use of Proceeds</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

