$3.9 million for the year ended June 30, 2024. The decrease was mainly due to the shares that we issued to our consulting service providers
were vesting in the year ended June 30, 2024 and the decrease of stock price for the year ended June 30, 2025, which we issued the stock
granted to our managements and employees stock with lower fair value of in the year ended June 30, 2025 as compared to the same period
in 2024.</p><div>

