<p style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Zeta Network Group (formerly
known as Color Star Technology Co., Ltd., the &#8220;Company&#8221;, or &#8220;Zeta&#8221;) is an entertainment and education company
which provides online entertainment performances and online music education services via its wholly-owned subsidiary, Color Star DMCC
(&#8220;DMCC&#8221;). The Company also engages in cryptocurrency mining via its wholly-owned subsidiary, Model Queen Limited (&#8220;Model
Queen&#8221;).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On June 29, 2025, the Company
changed its name from &#8220;Color Star Technology Co., Ltd.&#8221; to &#8220;Zeta Network Group.&#8221;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="text-decoration:underline">CACM Group NY, Inc.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On August 20, 2018, CACM
