<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On August 11, 2022, Color
Star Technology Ohio Inc. (&#8220;Color Star Ohio&#8221;) was incorporated in the State of Ohio and is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c58" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-18218">100</ix:nonFraction>% owned by the Company. As of
