AED <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c59" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueStockDividend" scale="0" unitRef="aed" id="ixv-18221">1,000</ix:nonFraction> nominal value and is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c60" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-18222">100</ix:nonFraction>% owned by the Company. DMCC was established to carry out the music industry business and its online
cultural entertainment platform, Color World, after the disposition of Color Sky Entertainment Limited (&#8220;Color Sky&#8221;) in January
