of China (PRC) with registered capital of RMB <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c62" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherAdditionalCapital" scale="6" unitRef="cny" id="ixv-18224">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million and is <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c63" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-18225">100</ix:nonFraction>% owned by Model Queen. Color Star Hainan was established to carry
