The Company recognized the operating lease ROU assets and lease liabilities on lease inception on August 4, 2023. The Company has not
made any lease payments, and the present value of unpaid lease payment was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-18366">206,875</ix:nonFraction> as of June 30, 2025.</p>

