interest expense of the convertible notes was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-18446">294,625</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c10" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-18447">81,922</ix:nonFraction> and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-216">nil</span>, respectively, and amortization of debt issuance costs was $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfFinancingCosts" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-18448">6,023,259</ix:nonFraction>,
