and other factors. In addition, the CODM is provided with disaggregated expense information by segment, including significant operating
expense categories as presented below. The accounting policies of the segment are the same as those described in Note 2.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The key measure of segment
